{"channelId":"UCnz__aIJPTDdOkj4rLUzeqA","row":["Horse Nation Rescue Sanctuary",null,"Welcome to Horse Nation Rescue \nSanctuary 🐎\n\nAt Horse Nation, we are dedicated to providing a safe haven for horses in need. \nOur mission is to rescue, rehabilitate, and provide a lifelong sanctuary for horses that have been neglected, abandoned, or are at risk.\n\nThrough this channel, we share the journey of our residents—from their first steps into the sanctuary to their incredible transformations. We believe every horse deserves a life of dignity, love, and green pastures.\n\n🎥 Join us for weekly updates on our rescues, rehabilitation stories, and life at the sanctuary.\n\nSupport Our Work:\nRunning a sanctuary takes a village.\n Your support helps provide hay, veterinary care, and a safe home for these majestic animals.\n\n🔗 [Insert Donation/PayPal Link Here]Thank you for standing with the Horse Nation. ❤️","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnz__aIJPTDdOkj4rLUzeqA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnz__aIJPTDdOkj4rLUzeqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:08.275Z","channelId":"UCnz__aIJPTDdOkj4rLUzeqA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"cd4335f67aaa11643843a848b6c8e55e7abb6ae01f8fd08aa87f51b33bef0e29","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"619702d27f2632c0543ebead25b4de2ec8e1b56bcee75ea079d75303ecd84bc6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnz__aIJPTDdOkj4rLUzeqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:08.275Z"},"followerAccounts":[],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"sanctuary.\n\nSupport Our Work:\nRunning a sanctuary tak